#: email.cpp:528
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains more than one "
"@. You will not create valid messages if you do not change your address."
msgstr ""

#: email.cpp:533
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not contain a @."
"You will not create valid messages if you do not change your address."
msgstr ""

#: email.cpp:538
msgid "You have to enter something in the email address field."
msgstr "आप मन ल ईमेल पता फील्ड मं कुछ भरना होही."

#: email.cpp:540
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not contain a "
"local part."
msgstr "जो ईमेल पता आप मन भरे हो वो वैध नइ हे, काबर कि ये मां लोकल पार्ट नइ हे."

#: email.cpp:543
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not contain a "
"domain part."
msgstr "जो ईमेल पता आप मन भरे हो वो वैध नइ हे, काबर कि ये मां डोमेन पार्ट नइ हे."

#: email.cpp:546
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains unclosed "
"comments/brackets."
msgstr ""
"जो ईमेल पता आप मन भरे हो वो वैध नइ हे, काबर कि ये मां बिना-बंद-किया टिप्पनी/कोस्ठक हे."

#: email.cpp:549
msgid "The email address you entered is valid."
msgstr "ईमेल पता जऊन आप मन भरे हो  वो वैध हे."

#: email.cpp:551
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains an unclosed "
"angle bracket."
msgstr ""
"जो ईमेल पता आप मन भरे हो वो वैध नइ हे, काबर कि ये मां बिना-बंद-किया कोनीय कोस्ठक हे."

#: email.cpp:554
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains too many "
"closing angle brackets."
msgstr ""
"जो ईमेल पता आप मन भरे हो वो वैध नइ हे, काबर कि ये मां बिना-बंद-किया कोनीय कोस्ठक हे."

#: email.cpp:557
msgid ""
"The email address you have entered is not valid because it contains an "
"unexpected comma."
msgstr ""
"जो ईमेल पता आप मन भरे हो वो वैध नइ हे, काबर कि ये मां अप्रत्यासित विराम चिनहा हे."

#: email.cpp:560
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it ended unexpectedly. "
"This probably means you have used an escaping type character like a '\\' as "
"the last character in your email address."
msgstr ""

#: email.cpp:565
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains quoted text "
"which does not end."
msgstr ""
"जो ईमेल पता आप मन भरे हो वो वैध नइ हे, काबर कि ये मां उद्धृत पाठ हे जऊन खतम नइ होवत हे."

#: email.cpp:568 email.cpp:632
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it does not seem to "
"contain an actual email address, i.e. something of the form joe@example.org."
msgstr ""
"जो ईमेल पता आप मन भरे हो वो वैध नइ हे, काबर कि ए सही ईमेल पता प्रतीत नइ होथे  जइसन "
"कि joe@example.org."

#: email.cpp:572
msgid ""
"The email address you entered is not valid because it contains an illegal "
"character."
msgstr ""

#: email.cpp:575
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The email address you have entered is not valid because it contains an "
"invalid display name."
msgstr "जो ईमेल पता आप मन भरे हो वो वैध नइ हे, काबर कि ये मां अवैध डिस्प्ले नाम हे."

#: email.cpp:578
msgid "Unknown problem with email address"
msgstr "ईमेल पता से अग्यात समस्या"

